    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The game is intended for an adult audience!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 90\u2019s point-and-click adventure games,\u00a0\u2018Overvakerne\u2019 is a comedy/satire point-and-click adventure game. It tells the story of Henriksen, a typical office worker who realizes he has been treated badly by his colleagues. This realization turns out to be &quot;the straw that broke the camel's back&quot;, and Henriksen sets out on a revenge spree. Take on the role of the vengeful Henriksen as you traverse the premises of his (unorthodox) workplace and exact revenge on his wrong-doers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Norwegian voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whopping 170 x 96 resolution!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly varied puzzles and problem-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is played using only the mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative game mechanics that break the third wall</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
